{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/18af1a614bc61c860de916608af64e0f.webp?t=1744215820\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the most powerful starship and dominate the entire galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your items and build your ship deck to transform a humble vessel into a mighty battlecruiser\u2014feared across the galaxy, even by the mightiest of empires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/b8e85914bafd98ca5299dc8febb8aa83.poster.avif?t=1744215820\" width=470 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/b8e85914bafd98ca5299dc8febb8aa83.webm?t=1744215820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/b8e85914bafd98ca5299dc8febb8aa83.mp4?t=1744215820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic, cutthroat battles across the solar systems as you face off against the ship builds of real players. Watch missiles explode and lasers light up the battlefield in a dazzling display of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/5c2cacb550d324a950376994cb156893.poster.avif?t=1744215820\" width=470 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/5c2cacb550d324a950376994cb156893.webm?t=1744215820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/5c2cacb550d324a950376994cb156893.mp4?t=1744215820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/extras/0cc67f26cb6ef4507034ce86e6c082d8.webp?t=1744215820\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic PvP auto-battler</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your starship by carefully placing, rotating, and <strong>synergizing</strong> powerful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexagonal inventory grid</strong> for deeper tactical gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> and unlock <strong>superior</strong> weapons and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous multiplayer battles with ELO-<strong>ranked matchmaking</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/751810?t=1744215820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/751810?t=1744215820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744215820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744215820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],